{"translation-revision-date":"2026-11-07 16:19:04+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"et_EE"},"Add New":["Lisa uus"],"Some errors occurred while deleting the post types: %s":["Postitust\u00fc\u00fcpide kustutamisel tekkisid m\u00f5ned vead: %s"],"Failed to create taxonomy.":["Taksonoomia loomine eba\u00f5nnestus."],"Where this taxonomy appears: REST API, admin UI, and front-end surfaces.":["Kus see taksonoomia kuvatakse: REST API-s, haldusliideses ja avaliku vaate pindadel."],"Core identity, post types, and activation.":["P\u00f5hiidentiteet, postituste t\u00fc\u00fcbid ja aktiveerimine."],"Edit this taxonomy. Expand the Labels section to adjust labels.":["Muuda seda taksonoomiat. Siltide kohandamiseks laienda jaotis Sildid."],"Define a new taxonomy. Fill in the essentials under General; expand Labels to customize.":["M\u00e4\u00e4ra uus taksonoomia. T\u00e4ida jaotises \u00dcldine olulised andmed; kohandamiseks ava Sildid."],"Add taxonomy":["Lisa taksonoomia"],"Quick edit taxonomy":["Kiire taksonoomia muutmine"],"Failed to update taxonomy.":["Taksonoomia uuendamine eba\u00f5nnestus."],"\"%s\" taxonomy updated.":["Taksonoomia \"%s\" uuendatud."],"Whether terms can be displayed in the Tag Cloud widget.":["Kas termineid saab sildipilve vidinas kuvada."],"Available in Tag Cloud widget":["Saadaval sildipilve vidinas"],"Whether terms are selectable in the theme nav menu builder.":["Kas termineid saab teema navigeerimismen\u00fc\u00fc koostajas valida."],"Available in nav menus":["Saadaval navigeerimismen\u00fc\u00fcdes"],"Whether to display a column for the taxonomy on the associated post type list tables.":["Kas kuvada taksonoomia veerg seotud postituset\u00fc\u00fcbi loendi tabelites."],"Show admin column":["N\u00e4ita administraatori veergu"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the Quick\/Bulk Edit panel.":["Kas n\u00e4idata taksonoomiat kiir-\/hulg