eks uuesti nuppu Automaatne t\u00e4itmine."],"Choose from the most used":["Vali enim kasutatute hulgast"],"Shown in the meta box when JavaScript is disabled. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Kuvatakse metakastis, kui JavaScript on keelatud. Ei kasutata hierarhiliste taksonoomiate puhul."],"Add or remove items":["Lisa v\u00f5i eemalda esemeid"],"Same as Parent item, with a colon at the end.":["Sama mis \u00fclemesemel, l\u00f5pus koolon."],"Shown in the taxonomy meta box. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["N\u00e4idatakse taksonoomia metakastis. Ei kasutata hierarhilistes taksonoomiates."],"Separate items with commas":["Eralda esemed komadega"],"The popular items text. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Populaarsete esemete tekst. Ei kasutata hierarhilistes taksonoomiates."],"Popular items":["Populaarsed esemed"],"Not used on non-hierarchical taxonomies.":["Ei kasutata mittehierarhilistes taksonoomiates."],"Parent item":["\u00dclemese"],"Label displayed after a term has been updated.":["Silt, mida kuvatakse p\u00e4rast termini uuendamist."],"\u2190 Back to Categories":["\u2190 Tagasi kategooriatesse"],"Back to items":["Tagasi esemete juurde"],"The text displayed when no terms are available in the term meta box and tag cloud.":["Tekst, mida kuvatakse, kui termini metakastis ja sildipilves pole termineid saadaval."],"New item name":["Uue eseme nimi"],"Update item":["Uuenda eset"],"A default term name is required.":["Vaikimisi termini nimi on n\u00f5utav."],"Once saved, updating the name creates a new term \u2014 the previous default term remains in the terms list. To change the term's slug or description, edit it from the terms list.":["P\u00e4rast salvestamist loob nime uuendamine uue termini \u2014 eelmine vaiketermin j\u00e4\u00e4b terminite loendisse. Termini p\u00fcsiviite v\u00f5i kirjelduse muutmiseks muuda seda terminite loendist."],"Default term name":["Vaikimisi termini nimi"],"Default term to be used for the taxonomy, similar to how \"Uncategorized\" works for categories.":["Taksonoomia vaiketermin, sarnaselt sellele, kuidas M\u00e4\u00e4ratlemata t\u00f6\u00f6tab kategooriate puhul."],"Set a default term":["M\u00e4\u00e4ra vaiketermin"],"Whether terms in this taxonomy should be saved in the order they are assigned to an item.":["Kas selle taksonoomia terminid tuleks salvestada selles j\u00e4rjekorras, milles need esemele m\u00e4\u00e4ratakse."],"Sort terms":["Sordi terminid"],"View terms":["Vaata tingimusi"],"Duplicate taxonomy":["Duplikaattaksonoomia"],"Failed to duplicate taxonomy.":["Taksonoomia dubleerimine eba\u00f5nnestus."],"\"%s\" taxonomy created.":["%s\" taksonoomia on loodud."],"taxonomy\u0004%s (Copy)":["%s (koopia)"],"One or more post types with which the taxonomy should be associated.":["\u00dcks v\u00f5i mitu postituse t\u00fc\u00fcpi, millega taksonoomia tuleks seostada."],"Post types":["Postituste t\u00fc\u00fcbid"],"This taxonomy key is already in use.":["See taksonoomiav\u00f5ti on juba kasutusel."],"Lower case letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes only. Maximum length: 32 characters.":["Ainult v\u00e4iket\u00e4hed, numbrid, alakriipsud ja sidekriipsud. Maksimaalne pikkus: 32 m\u00e4rki."],"Changing the key renames the taxonomy \u2014 existing terms may become inaccessible until a migration updates the database.":["V\u00f5tme muutmine nimetab taksonoomia \u00fcmber \u2014 olemasolevad terminid v\u00f5ivad muutuda ligip\u00e4\u00e4smatuks, kuni migreerimine andmebaasi uuendab."],"Taxonomy key":["Taksonoomia v\u00f5ti"],"When on, terms behave like categories with parent-child relationships. When off, terms behave like tags.":["Kui see on sisse l\u00fclitatud, k\u00e4ituvad terminid nagu kategooriad ema-t\u00fctre seostega. Kui see on v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitatud, k\u00e4ituvad terminid nagu sildid."],"Optional summary of the taxonomy. Shown in admin UIs that surface taxonomy details.":["Taksonoomia valikuline kokkuv\u00f5te. Kuvatakse haldusliidestes, mis n\u00e4itavad taksonoomia \u